Bound the wrong-certificate test and exercise the advertised version
matrix. Synchronize interrupted sends with persisted encryption state
and a full one-element event queue, keeping chunks pending for restart
and AUTH cleanup. Read prefix paths from the file record instead of
partial directory lookups.

Require durable completion and source cleanup when SFDONE is received.
Also interrupt a fully uploaded file before final progress and recover
its completion without a server, then download it to verify the
descriptions.

Access the added SndFile fields with OverloadedRecordDot and give the
local helpers explicit types so GHC 9.10 does not infer ambiguous
qualified duplicate record fields in patterns.

